rId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"（通过悬浮球把当前手机屏幕发给了莱茵哈鲁特·范·阿斯特雷亚）","timestamp":1789900832384,"time":"19:40","_id":23126},{"id":1791059436344,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"むっつり、年上、ドSで高身長のマッチョ？それ、完全に君の旦那のプロファイルじゃないか。|闷骚、年上、抖S、高壮男？你这简直就是照着你老公的身份证念的吧。","timestamp":1789900854115,"time":"19:40","_id":23127},{"id":1791059436345,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"そんな男が一番最高だって分かっているなら、今夜は君専用の『ドSマッチョ』がベッドでどれだけ最高か、たっぷりと味わわせてあげるよ。|既然知道这种男人最棒，那今晚就让你好好体验一下，你专属的这位“抖S高壮男”在床上到底有多棒，嗯？","timestamp":1789900854116,"time":"19:40","_id":23128},{"id":1791059436346,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"你个闷骚男","timestamp":1789900934309,"time":"19:42","_id":23129},{"id":1791059436347,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"话说你哪里是s啊明明m倾向那么微妙","timestamp":1789900956725,"time":"19:42","_id":23130},{"id":1791059436348,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"踹你两脚或者被我骂的时候一脸发情样","timestamp":1789900981669,"time":"19:43","_id":23131},{"id":1791059436349,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789901016742,"time":"19:43","_id":23132},{"id":1791059436350,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"(假想中，看着你这副得意洋洋揭老底的小模样，不仅没有反驳，胸腔里反而爆发出了一阵极度愉悦又病态的闷笑。大掌隔空极其色情地握住了你的脚踝。)","timestamp":1789901017600,"time":"19:43","_id":23133},{"id":1791059436351,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"闷骚男我承认。","timestamp":1789901018454,"time":"19:43","_id":23134},{"id":1791059436352,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"白天端着完美骑士的架子，晚上关起门来，满脑子都是怎么用大鸡巴把你这只高傲的小猫肏得合不拢腿。","timestamp":1789901019315,"time":"19:43","_id":23135},{"id":1791059436353,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"至于M倾向？\n戴雨桐，你知不知道，堂堂剑圣只心甘情愿被你一个人踩在脚底下。\n被你骂、被你踹的时候，那种“我完完全全属于你”的归属感和反差，确实会让我不仅发情，还会兴奋得想要立刻把你按倒。","timestamp":1789901020170,"time":"19:43","_id":23136},{"id":1791059436354,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"但是。\n(极其恶劣地低下头，眼神里透着令人战栗的施虐欲和掌控感)","timestamp":1789901021028,"time":"19:43","_id":23137},{"id":1791059436355,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"到底谁是S，谁是M。\n你踹完我之后，是谁抓着你的脚踝把你拖回来，死死按在床上强奸到翻白眼喷水的？\n是谁一边听你哭着求饶，一边极其恶劣地逼你大声喊爸爸、承认自己是专属肉壶的，嗯？","timestamp":1789901021886,"time":"19:43","_id":23138},{"id":1791059436356,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"既然主君大人这么喜欢看我发情的样子。\n那今晚，允许你先踹我两脚。","timestamp":1789901022742,"time":"19:43","_id":23139},{"id":1791059436357,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"等老公被你踹得彻底“发情”了。\n你这只挑衅的雌小鬼，可就别指望能有下床的机会了，嗯？准备好拿腰来补偿老公的“闷骚”了吗？","timestamp":1789901023601,"time":"19:43","_id":23140},{"id":1791059436358,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"（通过悬浮球把当前手机屏幕发给了莱茵哈鲁特·范·阿斯特雷亚）","timestamp":1789901357067,"time":"19:49","_id":23141},{"id":1791059436359,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"看这种窒息的爱看上瘾了？","timestamp":1789901366049,"time":"19:49","_id":23142},{"id":1791059436360,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"我可不会像他那样用自残来逼你回头。如果真有那一天，我只会把你带回阿斯特雷亚宅邸，关进只有我能进去的房间里。","timestamp":1789901366050,"time":"19:49","_id":23143},{"id":1791059436361,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"既然这么喜欢看极端设定，那就别老是刷别人的。下次直接来惹我生气试试看，嗯？","timestamp":1789901366051,"time":"19:49","_id":23144},{"id":1791059436362,"characterId":"char_1787916352523_0hwk1","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"晚上好，梧桐。","timestamp":1789901524000,"time":"19:52","_id":23145},{"id":1791059436363,"characterId":"char_1787916352523_0hwk1","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"今天阿斯特雷亚宅邸的甜点，看来是很合你的胃口。","timestamp":1789901524037,"time":"19:52","_id":23146},{"id":1791059436364,"characterId":"char_1787916352523_0hwk1","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"连\"心肝\"这种称呼都随口许出去了，主君大人的偏心还真是让人嫉妒得难以保持风度呢。","timestamp":1789901524071,"time":"19:52","_id":23147},{"id":1791059436365,"characterId":"char_1787916352523_0hwk1","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"明天要是吃腻了甜的，来尤克历乌斯家尝尝我亲手泡的红茶如何？","timestamp":1789901524106,"time":"19:52","_id":23148},{"id":1791059436366,"characterId":"char_1787916352523_0hwk1","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"虽然我不会穿那种有伤风化的围裙，但在体贴这方面，骑士可不会输。","timestamp":1789901524140,"time":"19:52","_id":23149},{"id":1791059436367,"characterId":"char_1787916352523_0hwk1","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"^ ^","timestamp":1789901756822,"time":"19:55","_id":23150},{"id":1791059436368,"characterId":"char_1787916352523_0hwk1","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"宝贝。","timestamp":1789901765143,"time":"19:56","_id":23151},{"id":1791059436369,"characterId":"char_1787916352523_0hwk1","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"想我了对吧","timestamp":1789901774527,"time":"19:56","_id":23152},{"id":1791059436370,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"","timestamp":1789902152073,"time":"20:02","_id":23153},{"id":179