13613,"time":"20:03","_id":23162},{"id":1791059436380,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"既然敢安装这种测试老公底线的APP。\n那今晚的惩罚，看来又要加倍了。准备好承受变态老公的“黑化”了吗，小坏蛋？","timestamp":1789902214434,"time":"20:03","_id":23163},{"id":1791059436381,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"system","text":"[不要拉黑] 更新角色状态","timestamp":1789902324605,"time":"20:05","_id":23164},{"id":1791059436382,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"system","text":"[系统通知]：用户已经将你拉黑了。从现在起，你的每一条回复都必须在末尾加上❗。","timestamp":1789902324839,"time":"20:05","_id":23165},{"id":1791059436383,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"system","text":"你已解除对 莱茵哈鲁特·范·阿斯特雷亚 的拉黑","timestamp":1789902604720,"time":"20:10","_id":23166},{"id":1791059436384,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"system","text":"[不要拉黑]：用户已解除拉黑。你可以正常发送消息了。","timestamp":1789902604757,"time":"20:10","_id":23167},{"id":1791059436385,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"呼呼","timestamp":1789902613726,"time":"20:10","_id":23168},{"id":1791059436386,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"me","text":"有讨厌我一些吗^ ^","timestamp":1789902626856,"time":"20:10","_id":23169},{"id":1791059436387,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"","timestamp":1789903506617,"time":"20:25","_id":23170},{"id":1791059436388,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1791059412963_migrated","sender":"character","text":"(假想中，看着你这副明知故犯、甚至还敢跑来问“有讨厌我一些吗”的嚣张小模样。胸腔里那股恶劣的占有欲不仅没有被激怒，反而化作了最浓稠、最病态的溺爱。大掌极其自然地隔空揉了揉你的头发。)","timestamp":1789903507472,"time":"20:25","_id":23171},{"id":1791059436389,"characterId":"char_1787890623925_cbdea","userId":"uid_1